# Curi core

Read root `AGENTS.md` before substantive work. Multi-step work: use `curi-manager` skill.

**Docs:** `docs/DECISIONS.md` → `FLOWS.md` → `PRD.md` → `ARCHITECTURE.md` / `DATA.md` / `AI.md`.

**TDD:** `docs/TDD.md`. **UX:** `docs/UX-PRINCIPLES.md`.

**Invariants:** Auth after first quiz · one lesson/path/day · multi-path Today · cache before Perplexity · lesson feel · free 2 paths.

**Prototypes** live in `prototypes/` — visual only; `docs/` wins on behaviour.
